Evidence Transparency System

This repository contains an alpha reference implementation and public protocol
materials for the ETS protocol.

ETS is patent pending. Patent filings, claim charts, USPTO receipts, assignment
records, and attorney-review materials are maintained outside this public
repository.

This alpha includes no production trust guarantee and should not be deployed as
a hosted evidence authority without completing the release, security, durability,
key-management, monitoring, and anchoring gates documented under docs/.
